---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Divider from '../components/Divider.astro';
---
<Base title={"Insurance We Accept | Tangible Therapy"} description={"Insurance We Accept at Tangible Mental Health: In-network with BCBS, SelectHealth, PEHP, TRICARE, United Healthcare, DMBA & more in Provo & Utah.  Schedule today!"}>
<section class="sec t-bright h-medium has-bg has-div" style="--divh:6vw">
<div class="sec-bg"><img src="/images/adobestock-1253588530-dd5435.jpeg" alt="Hand stacking wooden blocks with health insurance icons, for insurance accepted at Tangible Therapy in Utah" style="object-position:50% 50%" loading="eager"><div class="sec-ov" style="opacity:0.4"></div></div><div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:7;--mrows:9">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/6/6/22;--m:1/2/7/10"><div class="rte"><h1 class="ta-center">Insurance We Accept</h1><p class="lg ta-center">We make mental health care easier to access, with or without insurance</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:6/11/8/17;--m:8/2/10/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="/contact">Schedule Your Appointment</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<Divider type="wavy" height={6} width={100} fill="#fff" /></section>

<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:14;--mrows:23">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:2/9/4/19;--m:3/2/6/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3 class="ta-center">In-network providers</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:4/9/5/19;--m:5/2/7/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p class="ta-center">We currently accept the following insurance plans:</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:5/2/8/5;--m:8/2/10/5;--dz:5;--mz:5"><figure class="img fill" style="--fit:contain"><img src="/images/image-32f408.png" alt="EMI Health insurance logo with stylized green human figure between the words &#x27;EMI&#x27; and &#x27;Health&#x27; under insurances accepted at Tangible" width="441" height="114" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:5/6/8/9;--m:8/7/10/10;--dz:6;--mz:6"><figure class="img fill" style="--fit:contain"><img src="/images/image-1-43f3cb.png" alt="SelectHealth insurance logo with stylized check marks and the text &#x27;SelectHealth&#x27; under insurances accepted at Tangible" width="349" height="144" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:5/10/8/14;--m:10/2/12/5;--dz:7;--mz:7"><figure class="img fill" style="--fit:contain"><img src="/images/image-3-376863.png" alt="Logo of DMBA insurance with a stylized globe and text under insurances accepted at Tangible" width="300" height="150" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:5/15/8/18;--m:12/7/14/10;--dz:8;--mz:8"><figure class="img fill" style="--fit:contain"><img src="/images/image-4-75ff77.png" alt="United Healthcare insurance logo with blue stylized &#x27;U&#x27; and company name under insurances accepted at Tangible." width="401" height="126" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:5/19/8/22;--m:16/7/18/10;--dz:14;--mz:14"><figure class="img fill" style="--fit:contain"><img src="/images/image-12-353ae3.png" alt="A tricare insurance logo featuring three red wavy lines on the left, transitioning into a collection of five blue stars on the right, with the word &quot;TRICARE&quot; written below in red capital letters under insurances accepted at Tangible." width="1218" height="611" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:5/23/8/26;--m:16/2/18/5;--dz:10;--mz:10"><figure class="img fill" style="--fit:contain"><img src="/images/image-8-370a9c.png" alt="UMR insurance logo with black letters and a green curved underline under insurances accepted at Tangible" width="308" height="163" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:8/8/11/11;--m:10/7/12/10;--dz:11;--mz:11"><figure class="img fill" style="--fit:contain"><img src="/images/image-10-66f693.png" alt="Logo featuring a blue cross symbol with a human figure at the center and a separate blue shield with a snake wrapped around a staff, representing Blue Cross and Blue Shield insurance under insurances accepted at Tangible." width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:8/12/11/16;--m:12/2/14/5;--dz:12;--mz:12"><figure class="img fill" style="--fit:contain"><img src="/images/image-11-22f532.png" alt="Regence logo with a shield containing a caduceus symbol and the word &#x27;Regence&#x27; in black text under insurances accepted at Tangible" width="1449" height="387" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:8/17/11/20;--m:14/2/16/5;--dz:13;--mz:13"><figure class="img fill" style="--fit:contain"><img src="/images/image-12-d170b6.png" alt="Logo for PEHP Health &amp; Benefits with the text &#x27;PEHP&#x27; in oversized blue letters and &#x27;Health &amp; Benefits&#x27; in smaller blue letters underneath under insurances accepted at Tangible" width="2399" height="1158" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:12/6/15/24;--m:19/2/23/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="rte"><p class="ta-center">If your provider is listed, your sessions may be partially or fully covered, depending on your plan. We encourage you to verify the specifics with your insurance company before your first session.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-black h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:13;--mrows:20">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/15/13/26;--m:13/2/20/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/tangible-counseling-944d69.jpg" alt="Female therapist engaging in Individual counseling with a woman at Tangible Therapy in Utah. Inside a cozy office with warm tones and plants" width="2500" height="1578" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/2/6/12;--m:1/2/4/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>Therapy That Fits Your Budget</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/2/12/12;--m:4/2/13/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>We believe cost should never be the reason someone doesn't get help. That's why Tangible Therapy offers one of the lowest cash pay rates in the area, just $115 per session. And if you have insurance, your out-of-pocket cost is even less.</p><p>Our average clients with insurance pay only <strong>$25 per session</strong>. Real, high-quality therapy for the price of a dinner out.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-white-bold h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:13;--mrows:21">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/2/13/12;--m:14/2/21/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/tangible-61e310.jpg" alt="A group therapy session at Tangible Therapy in a well-lit room with group members sitting in a circle." width="3300" height="2550" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/15/5/24;--m:2/2/5/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>Out-of-network coverage</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:5/15/12/24;--m:5/2/13/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p><span class="c-accent">If we’re not in-network with your insurance provider, you may still have options. Many plans offer out-of-network benefits, which can reimburse a portion of your session costs.</span></p><p><span class="c-accent">We’re happy to provide a superbill, a detailed receipt that you can submit to your insurance company for reimbursement. Keep in mind that coverage rates and processing times vary between plans.</span></p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-black h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:12;--mrows:18">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/16/12/26;--m:11/2/18/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/tangible-13-09bc29.jpg" alt="a female therapist in a blue shirt at Tangible Therapy in Utah. Smiling and sitting across from a man on a computer screen in a brown shirt while they do therapy via telehealth." width="2093" height="1406" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/2/6/12;--m:1/2/4/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>Helpful questions to ask your insurance provider</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/2/11/12;--m:4/2/11/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><ul><li><p>Do I have out-of-network mental health benefits?</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>What percentage of the session cost is reimbursed?</p></li><li><p>Is there an out-of-network deductible I need to meet first?</p></li><li><p>How do I submit a superbill?</p></li></ul></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-white-bold h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:12;--mrows:17">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/2/11/12;--m:9/2/16/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/tangible-30-3272eb.jpg" alt="a female therapist in a green shirt at Tangible Therapy in Utah. sitting across from a woman on a computer screen in a brown shirt while they do therapy via telehealth." width="2500" height="1603" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/15/6/24;--m:1/2/3/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>Need help navigating your options?</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/15/10/24;--m:3/2/10/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p><span class="c-accent">We know insurance can be confusing. If you're unsure about what’s covered or how to get started, reach out. Our admin team is here to make things easier and walk you through every step.</span></p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:10/15/12/20;--m:16/3/18/9;--dz:6;--mz:6"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="tel:4352605406">Call us</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-black h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:13;--mrows:20">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:2/2/4/26;--m:1/2/4/10"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center">✺ Frequently asked questions ✺</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:6/2/14/13;--m:5/2/13/10"><div class="accordion"><details><summary>Whats the cost of sessions if I don&#x27;t have insurance?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Our cash pay discount is one of the lowest around. We charge $115 per session for clients without insurance. </p></div></details><details><summary>What if my insurance only covers part of the cost?</summary><div class="rte"><p>If your plan includes coinsurance or you haven’t met your deductible, you may be responsible for part of the session cost. We’ll let you know what your estimated out-of-pocket amount is so you’re not caught off guard.</p></div></details><details><summary>Which Insurances do you accept?</summary><div class="rte"><p>We accept many of Utah’s largest insurance providers, including: Selecthealth, DMBA, EMI, BCBS, PEHP, Tricare, United Healthcare, UMR.</p></div></details></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:6/15/14/26;--m:13/2/21/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="accordion"><details><summary>What&#x27;s the cost of sessions with insurance?</summary><div class="rte"><p>The cost of a session with insurance depends on a variety of things determined by your insurance plan. Our average client with insurance pays around $25 per session. If you’d like to know the cost of a session for you, give us a call, and our billing team would be happy to help.</p></div></details><details><summary>How often will insurance cover my sessions?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Most plans allow up to two sessions a week, while others set limits on how many visits are covered per year. You can call your insurance provider or ask us for help reviewing your plan details.</p></div></details><details><summary>Why did I get a bill even though I have insurance?</summary><div class="rte"><p>This usually happens when a deductible hasn’t been met or when the insurance plan only covers part of the session cost. If you ever receive an unexpected bill, contact us — we’ll help explain it and make sure it’s accurate.</p></div></details></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
